          "kinetic": 0
        },
        "movement": "4/20",
        "implants": "Basic Biomods, Basic Mesh Inserts, Cortical Stack, Eidetic Memory, Hyper Linguist, Math Boost",
        "advantages": "+10 COG, +5 INT, +5 WIL, +5 to one other aptitude of the player’s choice",
        "disadvantages": "",
        "skillBonuses": [],
        "cpCost": 40,
        "creditCost": "Expensive",
        "active": true,
        "description": "<p>Mentons are genetically modified to increase cognitive abilities, particularly learning ability, creativity, attentiveness, and memory. Rumors exist of super-enhanced mentons with more extreme intelligence mods, but brainhacking is notoriously difficult, and many attempts to redesign mental faculties result in impaired functioning, instability, or insanity.</p><p><em>Source: Eclipse Phase Morph Recognition Guide, p. 56.</em></p>"
      },
      "effects": [],
      "flags": {},
      "sort": 1000,
      "ownership": {
        "default": 0
      },
      "folder": null,
      "_key": "!actors.items!c288050b2494fa88.3678819d37cbc122"
    },
    {
      "_id": "ed32d32971e672c0",
      "name": "Allies",
      "type": "trait",
      "img": "icons/svg/upgrade.svg",
      "system": {
        "key": "allies",
        "traitType": "positive",
        "scope": "ego",
        "level": 1,
        "cost": 30,
        "costText": "Cost: 30 CP",
        "description": "<p>The character is part of or has a relationship with some influential group that they can occasionally call on for support. For example, this could be their old gatecrashing crew, former research lab co-workers, a criminal cartel they are part of, or an elite social clique. The gamemaster and player should work out what the character’s relationship is with this group, and why the character can call on them for aid. Gamemaster’s should take care that these allies are not abused, such as calling on them more than once per game session. The character’s ties to this group are also a two-way street—they will be expected to perform duties for the group on occasion as well (a potential plot seed for scenarios).</p><p><em>Source: Eclipse Phase Core Rulebook, p. 145.</em></p>"
      },
      "effects": [],
      "flags": {},
      "sort": 2000,
      "ownership": {
        "default": 0
      },
      "folder": null,
      "_key": "!actors.items!c288050b2494fa88.ed32d32971e672c0"
    },
    {
      "_id": "a3fb1ceda28d1256",
      "name": "Expert",
      "type": "trait",
      "img": "icons/svg/upgrade.svg",
      "system": {
        "key": "expert",
        "traitType": "positive",
        "scope": "ego",
        "level": 1,
        "cost": 10,
        "costText": "Cost: 10 CP",
        "description": "<p>The character is a legend in the use of one particular skill. The character may raise one learned skill over 80, to a maximum of 90, during character creation. This trait does not actually increase the skill, it just raises the maximum. This trait may only be taken once.</p><p><em>Source: Eclipse Phase Core Rulebook, p. 146.</em></p>"
      },
      "effects": [],
      "flags": {},
      "sort": 3000,
      "ownership": {
        "default": 0
      },
      "folder": null,
      "_key": "!actors.items!c288050b2494fa88.a3fb1ceda28d1256"
    },
    {
      "_id": "325d699e9243fc1e",
      "name": "Hyper Linguist",
      "type": "trait",
      "img": "icons/svg/upgrade.svg",
      "system": {
        "key": "hyperLinguist",
        "traitType": "positive",
        "scope": "ego",
        "level": 1,
        "cost": 10,
        "costText": "Cost: 10 CP",
        "description": "<p>The character has an intuitive understanding of linguistic structures that facilitates learning new languages easily. The character requires one-third the normal amount of time and experience to learn any language (see Improving Skills, p. 152). The character can also learn any human language in one day simply by constant immersive exposure to it. Additionally, the character receives a +10 modifier when attempting to interpret languages they don’t know.</p><p><em>Source: Eclipse Phase Core Rulebook, p. 146.</em></p>"
      },
      "effects": [],
      "flags": {},
      "sort": 4000,
      "ownership": {
        "default": 0
      },
      "folder": null,
      "_key": "!actors.items!c288050b2494fa88.325d699e9243fc1e"
    },
    {
      "_id": "33340b3ba96a61f2",
      "name": "Math Wiz",
      "type": "trait",
      "img": "icons/svg/upgrade.svg",
      "system": {
        "key": "mathWiz",
        "traitType": "positive",
        "scope": "ego",
        "level": 1,
        "cost": 10,
        "costText": "Cost: 10 CP",
        "description": "<p>The character can perform any feat of calculation, including the most complex and advanced mathematics, instantly and with great precision, with the same ease an unmodified human can add 2 + 3. The character can calculate odds with great precision, find correlations in numerical data, and perform similar tasks with great ease. Apply a +30 modifier on tests involving math calculations.</p><p><em>Source: Eclipse Phase Core Rulebook, p. 146.</em></p>"
      },
      "effects": [],
      "flags": {},
      "sort": 5000,
      "ownership": {
        "default": 0
      },
      "folder": null,
      "_key": "!actors.items!c288050b2494fa88.33340b3ba96a61f2"
    },
    {
      "_id": "f313b58877decd91",
      "name": "Psi Defense",
      "type": "trait",
      "img": "icons/svg/upgrade.svg",
      "system": {
        "key": "psiDefense",
        "traitType": "positive",
        "scope": "both",
        "level": 1,
        "cost": 10,
        "costText": "Cost: 10 (Level 1) or 20 (Level 2) CP",
        "description": "<p>The character’s mind is inherently resistant to mental attacks. At Level 1, apply a +10 modifier to all defense tests made against psi attacks. At Level 2, apply a +20 modifier.</p><p><em>Source: Eclipse Phase Core Rulebook, p. 147.</em></p>"
      },
      "effects": [],
      "flags": {},
      "sort": 6000,
      "ownership": {
